    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This is a web-based application that visualizes gentrification in the United States based on Census data from the 2011 and 2016 American Community Surveys. Using an index based on Census data, the application allows users to visualize the factors that affect gentrification for a specific U.S. geography (city, state and/or Census tract). The application is available for use at https://www.gentriviz.com.",
